<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="hero-title">AI Trainer 备考练习</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">人工智能训练师（三级）国家职业技能等级认定 · 备考练习</text>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <view class="notice-title ic-row">
      <view class="ic ic-14 ic-alert"></view>
      <text>免责声明</text>
    </view>
    <text class="notice-body">
本工具为个人备考练习程序，目前仅覆盖人工智能训练师（三级）的内容。
题库参考上海交通大学职业技能认证平台（gjzs.sjtu.edu.cn）公开资料整理，对应人社部《人工智能训练师国家职业技能标准》。
智能评测基于用户自行提供的第三方 API 密钥，结果仅供参考。
所有学习数据仅保存在本地设备。
    </text>
  </view>

  <view class="stats-bar" wx:if="{{stats}}">
    <view class="stat-item">
      <text class="stat-num">{{stats.attempted}}<text class="stat-denom">/{{stats.total}}</text></text>
      <text class="stat-label">已刷理论题</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <text class="stat-num">{{stats.accuracy}}%</text>
      <text class="stat-label">正确率</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <text class="stat-num">{{stats.wrongCount}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">错题数</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="loading-wrap" wx:elif="{{loading}}">
    <view class="loading-spinner"></view>
    <text class="loading-text">加载题库中…</text>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-grid">
    <navigator url="/pages/theory/theory" open-type="switchTab" class="entry-card" hover-class="entry-card-hover">
      <text class="entry-num">01 · 理论</text>
      <text class="entry-title">理论学习</text>
      <text class="entry-desc">单题练习、错题本、模拟考试和统计</text>
    </navigator>

    <navigator url="/pages/practical/practical" open-type="switchTab" class="entry-card" hover-class="entry-card-hover">
      <text class="entry-num">02 · 实操</text>
      <text class="entry-title">实操学习</text>
      <text class="entry-desc">代码填空和文档作答练习</text>
    </navigator>
  </view>

  <navigator url="/pages/exam/exam" class="exam-entry" hover-class="entry-card-hover">
    <view class="exam-entry-label ic-row">
      <view class="ic ic-18 ic-pen-primary"></view>
      <text>模拟考试</text>
    </view>
    <text class="exam-entry-desc">判断题40 + 单选题140 + 多选题10 · 限时90分钟</text>
    <view class="exam-entry-arrow ic ic-20 ic-chevronRight"></view>
  </navigator>

  <view class="footer-links">
    <navigator url="/pages/review/review" class="footer-link">
      <view class="ic-row">
        <view class="ic ic-14 ic-book"></view>
        <text>错题本与复习</text>
      </view>
    </navigator>
    <navigator url="/pages/settings/settings" open-type="switchTab" class="footer-link">
      <view class="ic-row">
        <view class="ic ic-14 ic-settings"></view>
        <text>设置</text>
      </view>
    </navigator>
  </view>
</view>